# CHECKSUMMED BYTES ARE NEVER LINE-ENDING-CONVERTED. A fixture's control file
# declares the md5 of the data file as committed; with core.autocrlf=true (the
# Git for Windows default) a checkout rewrites LF to CRLF, the md5 no longer
# matches, and ingest refuses the delivery -- correctly, since that is the
# integrity check doing its job. Linux CI never sees it.
tests/fixtures/** -text
